{
  "notes": "Cosmic electro, C lydian (the raised fourth: wonder, weightlessness), 106 BPM. FM bells (DIGITAL TRAP BELL) arpeggiate major-seventh voicings in eighths through a long quarter-note echo, an FM bass (DIGITAL FM BASS) plays a syncopated electro line, the player's robot voice on the Smart Keys (VOICE TALKBOX, gliding between vowels), and the ELECTRO kit (808 body, 606 hats, FM toms) on a broken electro beat. Scenes: A docks on Imaj7 and II, the lydian shimmer, the bass held long under the bells; B orbits Imaj7 II vii7 vi7; C lifts off on a bass that climbs vi7 vii7 Imaj7 II; D floats on vi7 and II in a huge room. ENERGY: the bells alone, then kick and bass, then clap, snare and hats, then sixteenth hats, every bell note, ratchets and fills. All material is original.",
